<title>USA: Air-Cure Q4 net operating income $0.09.</title>
<headline>Air-Cure Q4 net operating income $0.09.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.08	 loss     $0.02</p>
<p> Net profit	909	   loss     205</p>
<p> Revs		40,280		   27,327</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  11,617		   11,562</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.01	 profit   $0.07</p>
<p> Net loss	  86	    profit   760</p>
<p> Revs		110,804		  113,164</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  11,481		   11,552</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Air-Cure Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>Excluding non-recurring charges, net operating income for Q4 1996 was $1.01 million, or $0.09 per share, compared to $345,000, or $0.03 per share, for the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>Full-year operating net income for 1996 was $2.7 million, or $0.23 per share, compared to $2.1 million, or $0.18 per share, in 1995.</p>
